<title>USA: Albany County, N.Y., airport $96 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Albany County, N.Y., airport $96 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it repriced $96 million of Albany County, N.Y., airport revenue bonds, cutting the yield in 2019 to 5.77 percent from 5.80 percent.</p>
<p>Albany County Airport Authority</p>
<p>RE: $96,350,000*</p>
<p>Airport Revenue Bonds Series 1997</p>
<p>	   --We have received the verbal award.</p>
